2.POWER OF 2
Given a non-negative integer n, return true if it is a power of 2. Otherwise, return false.  
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public static boolean isPowerofTwo(int n) {
                return n>0 && (n&(n-1))==0;
            }
        }
